      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like the sheer pressure of existence itself has become a physical pain for you, and that feeling of being crushed is terrifying. When the demand to keep going feels like a threat, the desire for an absolute stop is a very understandable response to that unbearable strain. If these intense feelings of wanting it all to stop become overwhelming, please know there are people who want to support you through this crisis right now. You can connect with compassionate, immediate help by calling or texting 988 in the United States and Canada.",
